          <td colspan="2" height="30" background="newsheader.jpg"><font face="Times New Roman" size="4"><b><font size="5">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ToV foraging, Hate raiding, Trakanon TPW'ing . . .</font></b></font></td>
        </tr>
        <tr bgcolor="#330033"> 
          <td width="60%"><font size="2"><i><font face="Verdana">by <A href="javascript:createWindow('memberdetails.asp?id=33','profile','scrollbars,width=550,height=500')"><font color=yellow>Kayel </font></a></font></i></font></td>
          <td width="40%"> 
            <div align="right"><font size="2"><b>Posted: 12/11/01 3:34:11 AM</b></font></div>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td colspan="2">
<font face="Verdana" size="2"><B>Been a busy few days for the SoF crew!  Apparently, we're gluttons for punishment!                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    </B></font><P>
<font face="Verdana" size="2">Well, as per usual it's late in the depths of the nite, I should be sleeping, but I'm glued to my PC writing SoF news updates.  <br><br>Kayel improves at being a gamegeek.  <234><br><br>Sunday was busy - Borgir dragged SoF to PoH and made us die a bunch.  I mean, a whole bunch.  So much so that the entire plane dinged at least once.  I of course was cleverly at work so missed all the death and depravity.  However, amidst the carnage there were a few bits of light:<br><br>Adon on his etherial mist legs!<br>Lacandor on his Apothic BP and legs!<br>Borgir on his UBERHASTE Rakusha cloak<br>Aurah, Quxeos, Kantor, Kardil, Lucane on your drops which I'm too tired to list.  ;)<br><br>At this point I got home from work and figured it was time to mess up the server.  Falqour dragged SoF along with a few of his CIW friends (Matthi, Grayshadow, Taludana, Krystof, Aild and a few more not in my groups) to cause some ToV havoc.<br><br>At this point we laid the smacketh down on the zone and got no less than 2 sets of plate legs, 1 set of silk legs, about 23437 pairs of plate gaunts and boots and even a set of elusive chain arms.<br><br>To round out the nite in fine Sof tradition Moonwolf died a few times.<br><br>/thank CIW for teaching us ToV - expect to see us there more often now.  ;)<br><br>Monday was quiet - for some odd reason we partied around in Sebelis while we thought about killing Trakanon for the first time.  Unfortunately it took longer than expected and with an impending server shutdown coming we decided to throw caution to the wind and see if we could zerg our way into Trak just for the heck of it.  We expected to die, but imagine our surprise when:<br><br>Well... c'mon now, we died.  You didn't think we'd make it did you?  LOL.<br><br>/grin<br><br>But we have a grudge against that lizard now... took us a week or two to settle out with Lord Dijon after our first loss to him but we evened the score.  I expect Trakanon will see us again.  ;)<br><br>                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      </font>
</td>
        </tr>
